Features
Server-side validation (no client trust)
Speed, fly, and noclip detection
Server raycast hit verification
Aimbot & silent aim detection (multi-frame analysis)
Shot rate limiting (token bucket system)
Token + nonce security against remote spoofing
Headshot rate and streak analysis
Reaction time and target tracking checks
Reach and god mode detection
Infinite jump detection
Suspicion scoring with decay system
Adaptive thresholds based on ping
DataStore-based bans and log system
Batched logging for performance
Real-time admin alerts and commands
Optimized with round-robin processing

This project is still in active development.
Fully open-ource  you are free to modify and adapt it to your needs
